 msgid ""
 "Emitted when the node enters the tree.\n"
 "This signal is emitted [i]after[/i] the related [constant "
 "NOTIFICATION_ENTER_TREE] notification."
 msgstr ""
-"當該節點進入樹時觸發。\n"
-"這個訊號會在相關的 [constant NOTIFICATION_ENTER_TREE] 通知[i]之後[/i]觸發。"
