-msgstr "返回該節點是否通知其全域和局部變換的更改。[Node3D] 預設不會傳播此屬性。"
+msgstr "返回本節點是否會通知全域和本地變換的更動。[Node3D] 預設不會傳播此狀態。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Returns [code]true[/code] if the node is present in the [SceneTree], its "
+"[member visible] property is [code]true[/code] and all its ancestors are also "
+"visible. If any ancestor is hidden, this node will not be visible in the "
+"scene tree.\n"
+"Visibility is checked only in parent nodes that inherit from [Node3D]. If the "
+"parent is of any other type (such as [Node], [AnimationPlayer], or [Node2D]), "
+"it is assumed to be visible.\n"
+"[b]Note:[/b] This method does not take [member VisualInstance3D.layers] into "
+"account, so even if this method returns [code]true[/code], the node might end "
+"up not being rendered."
+msgstr ""
+"若本節點存在於 [SceneTree]、其 [member visible] 屬性為 [code]true[/code]，且所"
+"有祖先節點亦可見，則返回 [code]true[/code]。若有任何祖先節點被隱藏，則本節點於"
+"場景樹中亦不可見。\n"
+"僅會檢查繼承自 [Node3D] 的父節點的可見性。若父節點為其他類型（如 [Node]、"
+"[AnimationPlayer] 或 [Node2D]），預設視為可見。\n"
+"[b]注意：[/b]本方法不會考慮 [member VisualInstance3D.layers]，因此即使回傳 "
+"[code]true[/code]，節點最終仍可能未被繪製。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Rotates the node so that the local forward axis (-Z, [constant "
+"Vector3.FORWARD]) points toward the [param target] position.\n"
+"The local up axis (+Y) points as close to the [param up] vector as possible "
+"while staying perpendicular to the local forward axis. The resulting "
+"transform is orthogonal, and the scale is preserved. Non-uniform scaling may "
+"not work correctly.\n"
+"The [param target] position cannot be the same as the node's position, the "
+"[param up] vector cannot be zero.\n"
+"The [param target] and the [param up] cannot be [constant Vector3.ZERO], and "
+"shouldn't be colinear to avoid unintended rotation around local Z axis.\n"
+"Operations take place in global space, which means that the node must be in "
+"the scene tree.\n"
+"If [param use_model_front] is [code]true[/code], the +Z axis (asset front) is "
+"treated as forward (implies +X is left) and points toward the [param target] "
+"position. By default, the -Z axis (camera forward) is treated as forward "
+"(implies +X is right)."
+msgstr ""
+"旋轉本節點，使其局部前向軸（-Z，[constant Vector3.FORWARD]）指向 [param "
+"target] 位置。\n"
+"局部上向軸（+Y）會在與前向軸垂直的前提下，盡可能接近 [param up] 向量。最終結果"
+"為正交變換，縮放會被保留。非均勻縮放可能無法正確運作。\n"
+"[param target] 位置不能與節點座標相同，[param up] 向量不能為零。\n"
+"[param target] 與 [param up] 不可同時為 [constant Vector3.ZERO]，兩者也不應共"
+"線，以避免繞本地 Z 軸出現非預期旋轉。\n"
+"所有操作於全域空間進行，節點必須位於場景樹內。\n"
+"若 [param use_model_front] 為 [code]true[/code]，則 +Z 軸（資產正面）視為前方"
+"（+X 為左邊），指向 [param target] 位置。預設為 -Z 軸（攝影機前方）視為前方"
+"（+X 為右邊）。"
 
 msgid ""
