+"節點變換已改變。\n"
+"要啟用 [constant NOTIFICATION_TRANSFORM_CHANGED]，使用者需先透過 [method "
+"set_notify_transform] 主動啟用。若本節點處於編輯器環境，且至少有一個有效操作器"
+"時也會收到此通知。"
+
+msgid ""
+"[Node3D] nodes receive this notification when they are registered to new "
+"[World3D] resource."
