+
+msgid ""
+"Encodes a 16-bit unsigned integer number as bytes at the index of [param "
+"byte_offset] bytes. The array must have at least 2 bytes of space, starting "
+"at the offset."
+msgstr ""
+"Encode un entier non-signé de 16 bits en octets à l'index du [param "
+"byte_offset]-ème octet. Le tableau doit avoir au moins 2 octets d'espace "
